00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:53.680
AIIIIIRR!

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.700
Where's the goddamn air?

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.680
I..whaaa-how did I get..-

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.220
OH GOD

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.840
Please tell me that's water..!

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:01.460
Oh no...

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:02.280
Oh no

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.320
Wha-? HOW?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:04.880
HOW DOES THIS HAPPEN??

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:05.460
OH GOD!!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.000
I SEE IT!

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:06.820
*Screams*

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:07.760
NOOOOOO!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.000
*Screams loudly*

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.240
Uhhh....

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:11.260
Huh

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.760
Ho..-my God!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.060
OHHHH

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:15.540
I MADE IT!

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.440
Hooooooly crap!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.900
I didn't believe in myself for one goddamn second!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.440
I gave up already!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.320
I-I threw in the towel...

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.360
I'm a quitter!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.840
I'm a loser, baby!

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.560
- but I survived!

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:29.260
Okay

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:29.880
So

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.020
I'm gonna get back to my Seamoth, then I'm gonna get back...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:32.920
*pause*

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:33.880
...to the base

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:36.020
- because there apparently is a gun

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.360
That I can craft

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.220
There's a gun of some sort..-I dunno if it's a good gun..

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.360
The propulsion cannon

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.620
Maybe, with THAT

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.420
I can shoot things at the Reaper

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.220
- and kill it

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:48.700
but I doubt it's even possible TO kill the Reaper

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.240
BUT

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.180
We shall see...

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.260
- It's always..-I don't know why

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.580
I don't know how

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.240
and I don't know why

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.240
but always whenever I go to the Aurora

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:02.160
everything goes wrong and I nearly have a heart attack

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:06.960
Why can't I just have a nice, normal trip to the Aurora?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.720
Where things are fun and happy and filled with DREAMS

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.360
Hello, sharkiepoo

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.240
What're you gonna do?

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:13.800
Huh?

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.580
You wanna mess with me?

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.860
You doing back-flips to impress me?

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:17.740
I AM NOT

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.000
IMPRESSED

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.980
Karen: Welcome aboard, captain.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.160
This..um, *chuckles*

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.500
Are ya..-YOU OKAY?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.040
YOU GUYS OKAY?

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.640
YOU NEED SOME WATER?

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.740
I-I MEAN YOU GOT PLENTY OF WATER

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.260
- BUT DO YOU NEED SOME SANITY??

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.040
Oookay..

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:33.880
You have fun now...

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:34.800
You-You have fun...

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:35.340
You have fun

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:35.840
Okay...

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.120
Bonked my ship all over the place..

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.060
Annnd it's daytime

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:40.760
Okay

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.340
Gotta get back to base

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.100
Gotta get back to the base

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.180
*mumbles*

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.320
- but I can confidently say

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.080
- that I repaired the ENTIRE Aurora

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.440
And everything is A-OKAY now

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:56.480
Are you dead?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.140
- oh, you're not dead?

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.060
Well you're gonna be soon

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:58.640
BONK

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.740
*Laughs*

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:00.400
- sorry...

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.100
I'll leave you alone

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.840
with a few broken ribs and internal bleeding...

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.660
That's just the kinda nice guy I am

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:11.000
I bet I can build this base up a bit more but I'm not quite ready to go farming again

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.360
because farming...

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:13.920
...was a bit of a bitch

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:15.960
Well, not really it was actually quite peaceful

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.860
Karen: Welcome aboard, Captain

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.160
Thank you, baby

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:23.680
Alright so John Smith, you're gonna be my medical man

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:25.720
You're gonna house all my medkits

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.440
Thank you for that

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.640
- and maybe this power cell and these batteries...

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.500
and also this Aluminium Oxide

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:31.660
- and this Mercury Ore

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.580
I don't even know what the hell that do

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:34.820
But you're gonna keep it

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.440
And als...-

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.340
Land..-LAND MASS!?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:37.960
WHOAAAAAH

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:38.920
BACK UP A SECOND

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.260
LAND MASS

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:41.060
*inhales deeply*

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.680
Ohhhhhh

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.620
OHHHH

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:45.460
Oh

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:45.960
Ohh

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.540
OH

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:47.960
OHHH

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.320
Land mass...

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.900
...everyone said that there was an island available here

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.160
And I just got a signal

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.200
For a LAND MASS

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.000
Which I dunno if you guys know what that means

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.100
But to me

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.420
That means

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:02.520
ISLAND.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.080
OHH YES

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:04.800
*laughs*

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.840
We are in a good spot here

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:11.520
Also I noticed you need to eat a variety of food, so that you don't just eat only of one...

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.560
...because if you eat too many of one type of food you will get sick

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.560
Plain as that

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.880
- and I'm gonna put my last whole fish into my

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.060
LITTLE AQUARIUM

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.040
- I killed and ate all its friends

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:25.540
but it gets to live with the memory of that betrayal

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.400
With new friends that it cares nothing about

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.140
Okay

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:30.320
BE FREE

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.980
What if I just dropped the cooked -

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:35.020
- What if I just dropped the cooked fish in here with the rest of 'em?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.160
Oh that'd be so sad

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.080
Oops

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:37.580
I ate it...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.300
NEVERMIND

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.040
I ATE IT

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.920
And apparently I ate the raw one too

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.160
Well, SHIT

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.080
I didn't mean to do that!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.440
I meant to set 'em free!

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:48.820
But I forgot to drop it and instead I ate it...

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.120
So, anyway..

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.600
That's all the time that I got for this episode of Subnautica

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:58.120
In the next one, we are going to investigate where that land mass signal goes to

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.720
and maybe... just maybe, find us an island

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:02.220
so

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.000
Thank you everybody so much for watching

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.820
And as always

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.400
I will see you

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.020
In the next video!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.560
Buh-Bye!!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:21.620
[Outro Music: Crazy La Paint By MiniMusicMan]

